OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for causing wrong-way  
OL,4,Apolice chase crash                     
OL,6,FRogacs, of Acacia Close, Leicester, who
OL,7,Fhas pleaded guilty to causing serious  
OL,8,Finjury by dangerous driving and two    
OL,9,Fcounts of handling stolen goods, was   
OL,10,Fjailed for four and a half years at    
OL,11,FLeicester Crown Court on Wednesday.    
